{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your own millennium. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JRPG-style survivor action.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022Survive by collecting dot characters!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This title is a survivor action game with JRPG-style dot characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one general from a variety of professions and gather your friends to make up your party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your party with equipment items and special techniques to survive for the full time limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022Form a formation and meet the enemy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where should the collected characters be placed and in which direction should they attack?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your own unique formations to face the myriad of enemies that are closing in on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Formations can be freely changed at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022Let's make history that spans a thousand years!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each battle, the outcome is recorded in the history books.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various events are recorded according to the results of the war, creating your own personal history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is up to you to decide how the 1000-year battle will end in a multi-ending system.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Novice Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3211290/d42863e1144ba5498fb5119544dd7cae0d9344a3.jpg"},{"name":"Skilled Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3211290/7303a22d5c6c652e9e2bb5f479941556ff50c3f8.jpg"},{"name":"Master Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3211290/5c3e1c3e8584e3fd3f4f87af48a82a66e1afe671.jpg"},{"name":"Novice Runner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3211290/1bca04ec4496d92889a2dfaa2c7054eae3329f67.jpg"},{"name":"Skilled Runner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3211290/5ed9e072f8a1b1d320366751057961c3da82595c.jpg"},{"name":"Master Runner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3211290/775495d718eb8ef7e457e59456da980028995328.jpg"},{"name":"Novice Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3211290/ad12aa003da029c2f931aa04971fd74e3853f27d.jpg"},{"name":"Skilled Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3211290/bdee092920d3c98c90f8a1707498e5dfa99d41b7.jpg"},{"name":"Master Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3211290/e33a64592a37fdd98730826bcfe2bee14a287df5.jpg"},{"name":"Novice Chroniclers Writers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3211290/ba2ea6bbf927cae6b2eb3ab124894577eba6ff77.jpg"}],"total":92},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3211290?t=1743648415","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211290/7ba06e5ad88db424ef3c328edc3d092358bd0af8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743648415","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211290/3c62b42b2eaf176f268abca6207d3f4822409aa1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743648415","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211290/3c62b42b2eaf176f268abca6207d3f4822409aa1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743648415","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your own millennium. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JRPG-style survivor action.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022Survive by collecting dot characters!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This title is a survivor action game with JRPG-style dot characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one general from a variety of professions and gather your friends to make up your party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your party with equipment items and special techniques to survive for the full time limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022Form a formation and meet the enemy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where should the collected characters be placed and in which direction should they attack?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your own unique formations to face the myriad of enemies that are closing in on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Formations can be freely changed at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022Let's make history that spans a thousand years!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each battle, the outcome is recorded in the history books.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various events are recorded according to the results of the war, creating your own personal history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is up to you to decide how the 1000-year battle will end in a multi-ending system.</p>","developers":["peakvox","O-TWO inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211290/23287e41c1b059154b51c3235b9b3a8ff6617d11/header.jpg?t=1743648415","is_free":false,"legal_noti